sequenceDiagram
  %% Source for 13-xberg-auto-index-flow.html. Edit this file, then run ./scripts/render-diagrams.py.
  %% Directives: docs in diagrams/README.md (Updating diagrams).
  %% @subtitle The caller always gets the extraction; indexing into pgvector runs as a bounded background task in dev
  %% @type security: PR
  %% @type external: BGE
  %% @type database: PG
  actor C as MCP client
  participant LL as litellm-dev<br/>MCP gateway + index hook
  participant XB as Xberg<br/>egress through Squid
  participant PR as Presidio
  participant BGE as bge-m3<br/>remote GPU host
  participant PG as pgvector<br/>sme-knowledge

  C->>LL: MCP extract
  LL->>XB: extract the URL
  XB-->>LL: extracted text
  LL-->>C: return the extraction
  opt auto-index enabled and principal trusted
    Note over LL: background task, 3 min timeout
    LL->>LL: chunk text (about 4,000 chars, max 256)
    LL->>PR: anonymize every chunk
    alt any chunk not anonymized
      PR--xLL: indexing fails closed and is logged
    else all chunks anonymized
      PR-->>LL: anonymized chunks
      LL->>BGE: embed the chunks
      BGE-->>LL: embeddings
      LL->>PG: atomically replace the source's chunks
      PG-->>LL: indexed in sme-knowledge
    end
  end
